  "priorExpiration": "2007-07-28",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5501.04 \"Form DSSP 311\" means the “Offender Registration Information” form revised November 2022, whether written or electronic, that contains notice to the offender of the duty to report and the offender’s required information for initial registration, annual registration, semi-annual registration, quarterly registration, and any changes of information pursuant to RSA 651-B.\n\nSource. #5537, eff 1-1-93; ss by #6314, EMERGENCY eff 8-9-96, EXPIRES: 12-7-96; ss by #6324, INTERIM eff 8-22-96, EXPIRES: 12-20-96; ss by #6358, eff 10-22-96; ss by #6919, INTERIM, eff 1-1-99, EXPIRES: 5-1-99; ss by #6990, EMERGENCY, eff 4-30-99, EXPIRES: 8-28-99; ss and moved by #7066, eff 7-28-99 (from Saf-C 5501.03), EXPIRED: 7-28-07\n\nNew. #10121, eff 4-25-12 (from Saf-C 5501.03); ss by #13504, eff 12-9-22",
